---
/** Shown on draft pages, which only exist in `npm run dev`. */
---

<div class="mb-8 rounded-[2px] border-2 border-dashed border-accent-2 bg-card px-4 py-3 text-small text-muted">
  <strong class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase text-accent-2">Draft preview</strong> · Only visible locally. Set
  <code class="font-mono">draft: false</code> in the file's frontmatter to publish it.
</div>
